# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Nitara Special School — environment variables
# Copy to `.env` for local development; set the same keys in your
# hosting provider's dashboard for production.
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# Where contact-form submissions are sent.
#
# Any URL that accepts a JSON POST works — Formspree, Zapier, Make,
# a Google Apps Script web app, or your own mail service. The payload is:
#   { parentName, phone, email, childAge, concern, message, receivedAt, source }
#
# Until this is set, /api/enquiry returns 501 and the form tells visitors
# to call or WhatsApp instead — it never silently drops a parent's message.
NUXT_ENQUIRY_WEBHOOK=
